research/audit/wave7-topology-separation-urysohn.findings.md-150-The Cantor-set coding citation in `thm-normality-is-not-productive` passes from binary sequences to subsets of $\mathbb N$ by characteristic functions without naming that elementary bridge. The step takes well under 30 seconds and does not change the cardinal argument, so it was not proposed for repair.
